   "text": "LCI Barcelona - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nLCI Barcelona\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nLCI Barcelona is the most international school of design and visual arts&nbsp;in the Catalan capital due to the 23 campuses spread across the 5 continents that the Canadian network LCI Education has and which the School belongs. Born in 2013 after the association between LCI Education and the Felicidad Duce Fashion School, LCI Barcelona is a referent in the field of education in design, animation, photography and management of creative industries that attracts, year after year, students from all over the world who want to become competitive professionals.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 10:29\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n26/03/2026 10:29\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nSpain\nYearly Fees\nMax: €5,600.00\nMin: €5,300.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n30%\n420 of 1,400 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1928\nCampus(es)\nBarcelona\nCountry\nSpain\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n21/03/2024\nContract End Date\n31/12/2026\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ix5IqI388T0\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\nApplication Fee - EUR$50    ",
